<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - SGC Foundation - 140,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Sines 1-15/12 $5.65 fio scale load/30,000 shinc Portline.</p>
<p>ORE - Far Eastern Silo TBN - 60,000 tonnes Dampier/Kaohsiung 1-10/12 $5.80 fio 48,000 shinc/38,000 shinc China Steel.</p>
<p>There were no fixtures reported from New York on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
